---
import { hackspainSponsors } from "@/lib/hackspain-sponsors";
---
<section class="portfolio-bio" aria-label="About me">
  <ul class="bio-list">
    <li>
      I&apos;m from Spain <span role="img" aria-label="Spanish">🇪🇸</span> and I&apos;ve been building since I was <strong>9</strong>.
      <span class="bio-detail">I started with a Roblox game that reached <strong>20K peak players</strong> and <strong>223K combined video views</strong>.</span>
    </li>
    <li>I&apos;m a <strong class="current-role">product engineer at <a href="https://quiver.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img class="quiver-icon" src="/svg/quiver.svg" alt="" width="18" height="18" />{" "}QuiverAI</a></strong>, building AI tools for vector graphics. I&apos;m working my ass off to build the next-generation platform for designers.</li>
    <li>
      I co-founded <a href="https://hackspain.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">HackSpain</a>, a 36-hour hackathon bringing together <strong>250 young builders</strong> in Madrid.{" "}
      <span class="sponsor-section">
        <span id="sponsors-heading" class="sponsor-label">Backed by</span>{" "}
        <span class="sponsor-list" role="list" aria-labelledby="sponsors-heading">
          {hackspainSponsors.map((sponsor) => (
            <span role="listitem">
              <a href={`https://${sponsor.domain}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="sponsor-link" aria-label={sponsor.name}>
                <span class={`sponsor-tile sponsor-tile-${sponsor.logo}`} aria-hidden="true">
                  {sponsor.color ? (
                    <img src={`/svg/sponsors/${sponsor.logo}.svg`} alt="" width={18} height={18} class="sponsor-icon" />
                  ) : (
                    <span class="sponsor-icon sponsor-mask" style={`mask-image: url(/svg/sponsors/${sponsor.logo}.svg)`} />
                  )}
                </span>
                <span class="sponsor-name" aria-hidden="true">{sponsor.name}</span>
              </a>
            </span>
          ))}
        </span>
      </span>
    </li>
    <li>I also run my own app studio, where I&apos;ve launched stealth apps.</li>
    <li>Outside of coding, I&apos;ve been practising karate for eight years and hold a blue-brown belt. I also play football and enjoy discussing geopolitics with friends.</li>
    <li>I want to build a company that makes a positive impact and go to college in the US. For now, I&apos;m learning by building.</li>
  </ul>
</section>
<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLAnchorElement>(".sponsor-link").forEach((link) => {
    const name = link.querySelector<HTMLElement>(".sponsor-name")!;
    const positionName = () => {
      const room = document.documentElement.clientWidth - link.getBoundingClientRect().right - 24;
      link.dataset.labelSide = room < name.offsetWidth + 8 ? "left" : "right";
    };
    link.addEventListener("pointerenter", positionName);
    link.addEventListener("focus", positionName);
    window.addEventListener("resize", positionName);
    positionName();
  });
</script>
